<title>FRANCE: Club Med H1 1996-1997 turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Club Med H1 1996-1997 turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>(figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 3,866    vs    3,808</p>
<p>NOTE - The company released the figures in a statement. It said sales rose 1.5 percent. At comparable scope of consolidation and exchange rates, turnover was up 2.3 percent</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
